msgid "So, by eating foods like liver, you can add back that missing arachidonic acid, slowing brain aging and improving your memory. Impressive, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8576_Player"
msgid "Yeah. Never would have pegged liver for being brain food."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8588_Employee"
msgid "I also hear it can help young children learn faster. You just have to get them to eat it, haha!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8600_Employee"
msgid "Think of how many people are out there who don't eat liver at all. If you're one of them, and you want a brain boost, why not give it a try?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8612_Player"
msgid "(Eating liver makes your brain younger... Bet the girls at the club might like to hear about that.)"
msgstr ""

